@startuml
title 桌面壳、快捷键页面切换与当前页面宿主

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Main BrowserWindow" {
  [Current Page Host] as PageHost
  [Page Switcher Overlay] as Switcher
  [Minimal Status Bar] as StatusBar
  [Task Center Overlay] as Tasks
  [Settings Window / Page] as Settings
}

package "Keyboard Input" {
  [Alt+1..8 Direct Switch] as DirectHotkeys
  [Ctrl+Tab Cycle] as CycleHotkeys
  [Alt+Space Open Switcher] as SwitcherHotkey
  [Ctrl+K Command Palette] as CommandHotkey
}

package "Shell Services" {
  [Shortcut Router] as ShortcutRouter
  [Page Registry] as Registry
  [Page State Store] as PageState
  [Command Palette] as CommandPalette
  [Service Status Store] as ServiceStatus
  [Task Event Stream] as TaskStream
}

package "Registered Pages" {
  [Home Dashboard]
  [Agent Chat]
  [Knowledge Base]
  [Agent Management]
  [Code Repository]
  [Local Music]
  [情报中心]
  [小组件]
}

DirectHotkeys --> ShortcutRouter
CycleHotkeys --> ShortcutRouter
SwitcherHotkey --> ShortcutRouter
CommandHotkey --> ShortcutRouter

ShortcutRouter --> Registry
ShortcutRouter --> Switcher
ShortcutRouter --> CommandPalette

Registry --> [Home Dashboard]
Registry --> [Agent Chat]
Registry --> [Knowledge Base]
Registry --> [Agent Management]
Registry --> [Code Repository]
Registry --> [Local Music]
Registry --> [情报中心]
Registry --> [小组件]

Switcher --> Registry
Switcher --> PageHost : confirm selected page
CommandPalette --> Registry
CommandPalette --> PageHost : open page or command target

[Home Dashboard] --> PageHost
[Agent Chat] --> PageHost
[Knowledge Base] --> PageHost
[Agent Management] --> PageHost
[Code Repository] --> PageHost
[Local Music] --> PageHost
[情报中心] --> PageHost
[小组件] --> PageHost

PageHost --> PageState : save / restore page state
StatusBar --> ServiceStatus
Tasks --> TaskStream
Settings --> ShortcutRouter : remap shortcuts

note bottom
主窗口默认只显示 Current Page Host。
Page Switcher Overlay 只在快捷键触发时临时出现，
确认切换后关闭，不保留固定左侧导航。
end note

@enduml
